    {
      "text": "The as-cast HfMoTaTiZr baseline has a room-temperature yield strength of approximately 1600 MPa.",
      "field": "material_initial_state; baseline",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The as-cast HfMoTaTiZr baseline has a yield strength of approximately 855 MPa at 1000 °C.",
      "field": "material_initial_state; baseline",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Hf should be partially replaced by Al at replacement fractions x = 0.1, 0.2, and 0.3 in Hf1-xAlxMoTaTiZr.",
      "field": "intervention",
      "needs_support": false,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Al is a lightweight or low-density alloying element.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC5995863::chunk::001::introduction::a6c9e13965"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "Partial replacement of Hf by Al will reduce the density of HfMoTaTiZr.",
      "field": "hypothesis; mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC5995863::chunk::001::introduction::a6c9e13965"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "Each of the proposed Al-modified alloys will reduce density by at least 10% relative to the as-cast baseline.",
      "field": "hypothesis; predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Each proposed Al-modified alloy will retain room-temperature yield strength within ±10% of the as-cast value.",
      "field": "hypothesis; predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Each proposed Al-modified alloy will retain its 1000 °C yield strength within ±10% of the as-cast value.",
      "field": "hypothesis; predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The Al-modified alloys will sustain a single-phase solid-solution structure.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Lattice distortion will be preserved after Al substitution.",
      "field": "structural_mediator; mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The relevant electronic configuration will be preserved after Al substitution.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Lattice distortion is an essential solid-solution strengthening mechanism in as-cast HfMoTaTiZr.",
      "field": "structural_mediator; mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Al has a sufficiently modest atomic-size difference and suitable electronic contribution to preserve strengthening in HfMoTaTiZr.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Avoiding phase separation or first-order phase transformations is important for retaining structural performance at the operating temperature.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC8282813::chunk::002::results::f43af866b9"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "Excessive Al substitution may cause unintended phase transformations or loss of strengthening mechanisms.",
      "field": "uncertainty",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The proposed comparison will use as-cast specimens tested under uniaxial compression or tension at approximately 20–25 °C and 1000 °C.",
      "field": "conditions; falsification_experiment.design",
      "needs_support": false,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    }
